    "open_questions": [
      "His handedness: Wikipedia says \"He is left-handed\"; Modern Drummer (2020) says he plays the keyboard left-handed while drumming; at the Tiny Desk (2018) his hats are on his left, a right-handed kit.",
      "Where Speer and he met in 2004: at the Red Cat Jazz Cafe (Wikipedia, his page) or in Rudy Rasmus's gospel band (Wikipedia, the band's); both say they then played in that band.",
      "The kit on the records: Modern Drummer (2020) lists a 14x20 Gretsch bass drum, a 14x14 floor tom and a Diamond maple piccolo snare; the Evan Finds the Third Room tab writes a mid tom, which no source puts on his kit.",
      "Time (You and I) (2020): its only Songsterr drum track is marked regenerated, so it is not built.",
      "Ali (2022), A La Sala (2024), The Universe Smiles Upon You ii (2025) and Texas Moon (2022): not yet scored."
    ]
  },
